    "detailed_description": "<h1>PUBLIC PLAYTESTING</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grab your friends and request access to the pre-alpha playtest build. Follow our Steam Community Page for updates on the next public playtest.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fef37f55579b936e42ebd01557c0aafe.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/1da3845bf2d159b965b33011d070cb5e.webp?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">One of your friends has been possessed by one of the 7 deadly Sins! Work as a team to identify and banish this deadly Sin hiding amongst you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with 5-15 players in the <strong>Multiplayer</strong> <u>OR</u> Play alone against crafty AI in the <strong>Single-player</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whilst investigating areas of paranormal activity trust and suspicion intertwine as those who remain Human attempt to unravel the identities of the disguised Sins before being taken out. Banish Sins from the game either in combat, or via collective vote.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/c1d69e7bd4087e0b30df02a80e389707.poster.avif?t=1747574161\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/c1d69e7bd4087e0b30df02a80e389707.webm?t=1747574161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/c1d69e7bd4087e0b30df02a80e389707.mp4?t=1747574161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fef37f55579b936e42ebd01557c0aafe.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring personal equipment to gather evidence cooperatively or alone to expose the Sins identity. Think you know who the Sin is? Gather around the evidence table to start a vote. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/6c7d90ac47383fdf94bac0df47617809.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fef37f55579b936e42ebd01557c0aafe.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the essence of the Sins\u2019 souls lurking in areas around the map where it can be captured. Deposit the essence into a bubbling cauldron to weaken the Sins you believe are in play. Be sure to keep the fire alive as Sins will aim to extinguish the cauldrons fire before their essence is destroyed.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/4b84d90cf198fa569d136ae27f57c4f0.poster.avif?t=1747574161\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/4b84d90cf198fa569d136ae27f57c4f0.webm?t=1747574161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/4b84d90cf198fa569d136ae27f57c4f0.mp4?t=1747574161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fef37f55579b936e42ebd01557c0aafe.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/e961a2482febff475422027bcb2d4d10.webp?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sins are able to transform between their disguised human form, and their true Sin identity. Once in their Sin form, each Sin has their own unique abilities that will facilitate different playstyles to combat the Humans and keep their Sin identity hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/d5c758c5223982d294b2f86922e1fc15.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PRIDE</strong>: Manipulates the environment and players alike, commanding others as if they were lesser beings. Ethereal and elusive, Pride is a ghostly entity with an aura of arrogance and control.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/cf83168ff942cfc9777a9b2384cb46e5.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GREED:</strong> Greed sneakily stashes items around the map into an ever-growing sack, storing up power to deliver devastating attacks. As a cursed corpse with a hunger for riches, Greed must betray and eliminate all players - including fellow Sins - to win!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/aedfb51dfb2fd479c3ccac0ad7c68079.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>LUST:</strong> As a demonic marionette with a seductive twist, Lust weaves manipulation and mimicry into their gameplay. Pull unsuspecting Humans in and puppeteer their corpse to further deceive players.       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/e39a3cc7bf5a2bf05e6379d3d6b224ee.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ENVY:</strong>\u00a0Able to vanish briefly or mimic others to get close unnoticed, this small zombie draws near from behind in silent yearning - lashing out with a deafening scream before fleeing into the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/d0cc92d358f018a8e38efe7c2b068313.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GLUTTONY: </strong>Big, grotesque, and slow-moving, Gluttony corners prey and devours them whole - leaving no trace behind. This colossal ghoul exists purely to consume, driven by an endless, dripping hunger.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/3b390f895534c7898eb77578f2f1881e.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WRATH: </strong>Wrath is small, fast, and vicious, darting through shadows to hack and slash enemies. The more damage Wrath deals, the stronger they become. This vampiric predator thrives on fury and bloodlust, growing into a true nightmare if left unchecked.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fae7c8de09e6e03b7601147333d2c46f.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SLOTH: </strong>A sluggish but dangerous hulking behemoth. Sloth is forever burdened by heavy chains, stalking slowly, attacking only in short, sudden bursts.      </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fef37f55579b936e42ebd01557c0aafe.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Support our small indie studio - <strong>Wishlist now!</strong></p>",
