eceive players.       </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/e39a3cc7bf5a2bf05e6379d3d6b224ee.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ENVY:</strong>\u00a0Able to vanish briefly or mimic others to get close unnoticed, this small zombie draws near from behind in silent yearning - lashing out with a deafening scream before fleeing into the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/d0cc92d358f018a8e38efe7c2b068313.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GLUTTONY: </strong>Big, grotesque, and slow-moving, Gluttony corners prey and devours them whole - leaving no trace behind. This colossal ghoul exists purely to consume, driven by an endless, dripping hunger.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/3b390f895534c7898eb77578f2f1881e.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WRATH: </strong>Wrath is small, fast, and vicious, darting through shadows to hack and slash enemies. The more damage Wrath deals, the stronger they become. This vampiric predator thrives on fury and bloodlust, growing into a true nightmare if left unchecked.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2174060/extras/fae7c8de09e6e03b7601147333d2c46f.avif?t=1747574161\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SLOTH: </strong>A sluggish but dangerous hulking behemoth. Sloth is forever burdened by heavy chains, stalking